{"id":"62bd0ea842ce3981","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-boolean-value.md","title":"Boolean Value","display":"df-boolean-value — Boolean Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-boolean-value","aliases":["58-df-boolean-value"],"display":"df-boolean-value — Boolean Value","depends_on":["[[58-df-complete-boolean]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-boolean-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-boolean-value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-value — Boolean Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"58-df-complete-boolean\">58-df-complete-boolean</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\)</span> is the assignment predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"258c3795028ee0ac\" href=\"?note=258c3795028ee0ac\" title=\"58-df-complete-boolean\">58-df-complete-boolean</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\)</span> is the assignment set defined below (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(v_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S\\)</span> is the ten-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value\\text{-}assignments} \\vdash \\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}:\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value\\text{-}assignments} \\vdash \\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}:\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S(\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land\nv_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land v:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;(v(\\alpha,s)=v_0(\\alpha,s))\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\bigl(v(\\neg\\varphi,s)=\\neg_{\\mathbb B}(v(\\varphi,s))\\land v(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)=v(\\varphi,s)\\vee_{\\mathbb B}v(\\psi,s)\\bigr)\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\left(v(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)=\\bigwedge_{a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)}^{\\mathbb B}v(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S(\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land\nv_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land v:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;(v(\\alpha,s)=v_0(\\alpha,s))\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\bigl(v(\\neg\\varphi,s)=\\neg_{\\mathbb B}(v(\\varphi,s))\\land v(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)=v(\\varphi,s)\\vee_{\\mathbb B}v(\\psi,s)\\bigr)\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\left(v(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)=\\bigwedge_{a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)}^{\\mathbb B}v(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boolean-valued models assign truth values to formulas.</li>\n<li>This is the algebraic approach to forcing.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complete-boolean","status":"resolved","id":"258c3795028ee0ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complete-boolean]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\in V$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)$ is the assignment predicate from [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complete-boolean","status":"resolved","id":"258c3795028ee0ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})$ (see [[58-df-complete-boolean]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Asn}(M)$ is the assignment set defined below (see [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Asn}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value\\text{-}assignments} \\vdash \\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}:\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanValuation}_S(\\Sigma,\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},M,v_0,v)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb B,\\wedge_{\\mathbb B},\\vee_{\\mathbb B},\\neg_{\\mathbb B},0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\land\nv_0:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land v:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\to\\mathbb B\\land{}\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;(v(\\alpha,s)=v_0(\\alpha,s))\\land{}\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\bigl(v(\\neg\\varphi,s)=\\neg_{\\mathbb B}(v(\\varphi,s))\\land v(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)=v(\\varphi,s)\\vee_{\\mathbb B}v(\\psi,s)\\bigr)\\land{}\\\\\n&\\quad\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Asn}(M)\\;\\left(v(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)=\\bigwedge_{a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)}^{\\mathbb B}v(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2452,"backlinks":[{"id":"6a8759de7e97da40","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-boolean-value.md|58-df-boolean-value]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["258c3795028ee0ac","65418b505fc5309